  "label": "sunscreen",
  "description": "A chemical or physical substance applied to the skin to protect against ultraviolet (UV) radiation from the sun. It is a common personal care product used to prevent sunburn and reduce the risk of skin cancer. The meme humorously equates the absence of hair (which cannot absorb UV rays) with the function of sunscreen, implying that the bald head is a 'natural sunscreen'.",
